WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.070
A sperm cell has a tail,
so it can swim to an egg.

2
00:00:04.120 --> 00:00:05.850
But a flower can't swim.

3
00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:07.030
It can't walk.

4
00:00:07.080 --> 00:00:09.270
It can't move from place to place.

5
00:00:09.320 --> 00:00:13.830
Yet to make seeds, pollen must
get from an anther to a stigma.

6
00:00:13.880 --> 00:00:17.350
So how does pollen travel
from one flower to another?

7
00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:20.730
In this mission, you'll meet
the male and female gametes,

8
00:00:20.780 --> 00:00:23.530
and see what happens at fertilisation.

9
00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:25.210
Then you'll look inside a flower,

10
00:00:25.260 --> 00:00:28.870
and find out how seeds get spread
away from the parent plant.

11
00:00:28.920 --> 00:00:34.100
Your mission: explain how pollen
gets from flower to flower.
